%% GTR70E WYVERN — MOTOR-ejection recovery at the bulkhead joint (no CO2, no pyro bay, no FC actuation)
%% Regenerated against we4_flightsim.py + we4_ejection_feasibility.py.
flowchart TD
    B[Burnout t=3.45 s] --> C[Coast; TVC neutral; FC logs only]
    C --> A[Apogee 6.67 s / 121.1 m / 397 ft]
    A --> E[F15-4 ejection charge fires t=7.45 s, +0.78 s past apogee, 7.7 m/s]
    E --> TU[Gas pressurizes the Lower BT directly against the bulkhead joint]
    TU --> P[Bulkhead joint sees ~140 kPa vs 14-41 kPa release threshold]
    P --> N[Joint releases -> two body tubes separate -> 24 in chute + Nomex -> 4.8 m/s descent]
